{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_019D90","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，我们研发班又开发出一种新的碳酸饮料。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":62,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"不用不用，已经够了。马黛茶和Mountain Dew我都喝得很满足。足够了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY; PROPER_NAME_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"是吗？不过这东西也相当不错。喝过一次就再也离不开了。说真的，我现在手里都还拿着。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"喂，认真点……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"Kaz！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"口感浓郁却又利落清爽……好喝得过分。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"……再好喝，喝太多的话卡路里也……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"而且是零卡路里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"零……？我都怀疑自己听错了！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"这么有满足感，竟然零卡路里！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"等你喝了再怀疑自己的耳朵吧。到时候别的东西可都替代不了了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"没错。迟早有一天，全世界时髦的男男女女都会进入离不开它的时代。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"憧憬会催生新的憧憬，最终变成把全人类都卷进去的巨大漩涡。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"Snake，不，Boss，你会成为那漩涡的中心。抢先一步引领那个时代吧！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"明明又不是你做出来的，口气倒真大……它叫什么名字？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"嗯？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"那款碳酸饮料的名字。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"名字是……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"PEPSI NEX。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY; PROPER_NAME_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"PEPSI……NEX……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":20,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY; PROPER_NAME_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"PEPSI NEX！！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY; PROPER_NAME_PRESERVED"}]}